        "header": "3Benchmark Construction",
        "images": [
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.13021/2610.13021v1/tongbench_pipeline_overview_lrx_refine.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Overview of the construction process ofEmbodiedCLBench.During task generation, basic tasks connect a few atomic actions into simple household operations, and advanced tasks combine elements from multiple basic tasks into compositional tasks.\nFor each task, a state-transition graph is built, with each graph node as an intermediate state and paired with action options and a first-person-view image.\nDuring evaluation, the agent observes the current state and selects from candidate actions. After each selection, the agent transitions to the next node on the graph.",
                "position": 437
            }
        ]
